00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:01.680
Europe's Sentinel-1D radar satellite has begun operations.

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:05.400
It is expanding the continent's radar observation network.

00:05:06.040 --> 00:05:09.060
The satellite will support monitoring of land, sea,

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:12.440
